  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention includes training of ASEAN staff in damage and loss assessments, coordination of humanitarian interventions as well as direct project support to early recovery efforts at community level. The involvement of GFDRR in conducting comprehensive assessments and recovery planning will ensure that rehabilitation and reconstruction strategies will build on and fully integrate DRR.</narrative>
